      "source_notes": [
        "The Gate Hall is the surface floor at anchor plus (0,18); the solid massif radius is 25.",
        "The Sunken Deep is carved and populated at world-build time but its descending stair is absent until the Deepholds infestation quest is completed.",
        "Source stair transitions are one shaft per level; the Vault and Runeforge share floor -2 and the mine and Lower Tunnels are reached by walking through connected corridors."
